  "description": {
    "es-ES": "Cien cartas de dirección espiritual de san Juan de Ávila a predicadores, sacerdotes, señoras, doncellas y religiosas, y a Teresa de Jesús, san Juan de Dios, san Ignacio y san Francisco de Borja; la colección del Epistolario espiritual en la edición modernizada del Apostolado Mariano (2012), que traduce al español sus citas latinas entre corchetes.",
    "en-US": "One hundred letters of spiritual direction by St. John of Ávila to preachers, priests, ladies, maidens and nuns, and to Teresa of Jesus, St. John of God, St. Ignatius and St. Francis Borgia: the Epistolario espiritual collection in the modernised Apostolado Mariano digital edition (2012), which glosses his Latin quotations in Spanish in square brackets.",
    "pt-BR": "Cem cartas de direção espiritual de São João de Ávila a pregadores, sacerdotes, senhoras, donzelas e religiosas, e a Teresa de Jesus, São João de Deus, Santo Inácio e São Francisco de Borja."
  },
  "composed": "1535–1569",
  "languages": [
    "es-ES"
  ],
  "work": "john-of-avila/epistolario",
  "editions": {
    "es-ES": {
      "editor": "Apostolado Mariano (modernised digital edition)",
      "year": 2012
    }
  },
  "sources": [
    {
      "language": "es-ES",
      "url": "https://archive.org/details/obras-de-san-juan-de-avila-tomo-2",
      "edition": "Epistolario espiritual de San Juan de Ávila, Apostolado Mariano digital edition, 10 May 2012 (archive.org upload 'Cartas'); Tesseract OCR.",
      "description": "The 100 letters in the book's own order and numbering; the editor's footnotes are kept. Latin quotations are translated in square brackets by the editor. Printed page numbers removed. The BAC critical edition (Sala Balust 1952, 252 letters) is not used because its OCR carries line numbers and line-keyed apparatus.",
      "tier": "B",
      "tierEvidence": "Ávila's letters are public domain; the modernised edition is freely posted on archive.org."
    },
    {
      "language": "es-ES",
      "url": "https://archive.org/details/obrascompletased01avil",
      "edition": "Obras completas del B. Mtro. Juan de Ávila, ed. L. Sala Balust, BAC 1952, vol. I (Epistolario, pp. 257 ff.). Reference only, for checking readings.",
      "description": "Not imported.",
      "tier": "B",
      "tierEvidence": "Same letters, critical text."
    }
  ],
